<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Cairn has more than 50 pct of Command.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Cairn has more than 50 pct of Command.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K. resources group Cairn Energy Plc has gained more than 50 percent of takeover target Command Petroleum Holdings NL, according to a statement to the Australian Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>Cairn said it had become entitled to 182.21 million Command shares, or about 56.5 percent of the company's issued capital.</p>
<p>The British group is offering $A1.10 for each Command share or two Cairn shares for every 13 Command shares.</p>
<p>The cash offer has been extended until November 28, but the scrip offer ends today.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
